  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Smaller the size of anion, smaller is the covalent character and higher will be its melting point. Hence, the order of melting point of lithium salts is $\\mathrm{LiF}\\gt\\mathrm{LiCl}\\gt\\mathrm{LiBr}$.",
    "image": null
  },
